    # mc "Sí, salgo con ella, pero prácticamente nadie sabe lo mío con ella. Déjame acalararlo y todo será más... normal."
    mc "Yes, I'm dating her, but practically no one knows about me and her. Let me just settle it and everything will be more... normal."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1618
translate english c14s003_SairaChat_08077c6f:

    # mc "Sí, salgo con las dos, pero prácticamente nadie sabe lo mío con ellas. Déjame acalararlo y todo será más... normal."
    mc "Yes, I'm dating both of them, but practically no one knows about me and them. Let me just settle it and everything will be more... normal."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1620
translate english c14s003_SairaChat_5ef88d97_1:

    # mc "Pero prácticamente nadie lo sabe. Déjame acalararlo y todo será más... normal."
    mc "But practically no one knows. Let me just settle it and everything will be more... normal."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1621
translate english c14s003_SairaChat_63f3904d_1:

    # mc "También debes saber que salgo con alguien más. Y no me preguntes con quién, por favor."
    mc "You should also know that I'm dating someone else. And don't ask me who, please."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1623
translate english c14s003_SairaChat_67b300bf:

    # sai "Entonces... ¿A qué a venido el beso en el aeropuerto? No lo entiendo... ¿un beso en la mejilla?"
    sai "So... What's with the kiss at the airport? I don't get it... A kiss on the cheek?"

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1624
translate english c14s003_SairaChat_b5b1f26d_1:

    # mc "Saira, mi vida se ha complicado desde que volví a Newport. No pensaba que volvería a verte..."
    mc "Saira, my life has been complicated since I came back to Newport. I didn't think I would ever see you again..."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1626
translate english c14s003_SairaChat_3de56139_1:

    # sai "¡Te dije que vendría a visitarte!"
    sai "I told you I'd come to visit you!"

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1627
translate english c14s003_SairaChat_bbc10f7c_1:

    # mc "Sí, pero no a vivir en casa."
    mc "Yes, but not to live at home."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1628
translate english c14s003_SairaChat_950b8af9_1:

    # mc "Y a lo que me refería era que no sabía si volvería a verte a corto plazo. Deseaba volver a verte, que cuando acabaras el año que te queda me llamases..."
    mc "And what I meant was that I didn't know if I would see you again anytime soon. I wanted to see you again, I figured when you finished the year you had left, you would call me..."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1629
translate english c14s003_SairaChat_af967366_1:

    # mc "Pero no sabía si sucedería. No me dijiste que pensabas mudarte aquí."
    mc "But I didn't know if it would happen. You didn't tell me you were planning to move here."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1631
translate english c14s003_SairaChat_4830b8b8_1:

    # sai "Lo sé. Y sé que debería haberlo hecho."
    sai "I know. And I know I should have."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1632
translate english c14s003_SairaChat_413d2c48_1:

    # mc "Sí, deberías."
    mc "Yes, you should have."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1634
translate english c14s003_SairaChat_59208d93_1:

    # sai "Entonces... ¿Quieres que dejemos lo nuestro?"
    sai "So... Do you want to break up?"

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1635
translate english c14s003_SairaChat_1be28cd7_1:

    # sai "Sólo he venido para el curso de verano. El transfer de Portland a Newport todavía está en proceso..."
    sai "I'm only here for the summer course. The transfer from Portland to Newport is still in process..."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1636
translate english c14s003_SairaChat_e4babfbe_1:

    # sai "Si no quieres estar conmigo... lo paralizaría y volvería a Portland a acabar la carrera."
    sai "If you don't want to be with me... I'll freeze it and go back to Portland to finish my degree."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1637
translate english c14s003_SairaChat_ddb44c64:

    # mc "Saira, en ningún momento he dicho que no quiera estar contigo... pero necesito tiempo."
    mc "Saira, at no time have I said I don't want to be with you... but I need time."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1639
translate english c14s003_SairaChat_51a93fb4:

    # sai "¿Entonces...?"
    sai "So...?"

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1641
translate english c14s003_SairaChat_7f4c1b9c_1:

    # mc "Pero no puedo estar contigo como estábamos en Portland. O para ser más exactos, sí, precisamente como estábamos en Portland."
    mc "But I can't be with you like we were in Portland. Or to be more exact, yes, precisely as we were in Portland."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1642
translate english c14s003_SairaChat_f9bb63a0_2:

    # mc "Allí teníamos una relación abierta. Ninguno de los dos hizo nada fuera de la relación, pero los dos aceptamos que el otro pudiera hacerlo."
    mc "We had an open relationship there. Neither of us did anything outside of the relationship, but we both accepted that the other one could do it."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1643
translate english c14s003_SairaChat_54bc11c1_1:

    # mc "¿Serías capaz de volver a aceptar una relación así?"
    mc "Would you be able to accept such a relationship again?"

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1645
translate english c14s003_SairaChat_6c391479_1:

    # mc "Pero no quiero estar contigo como estábamos en Portland."
    mc "But I don't want to be with you like we were in Portland."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1646
translate english c14s003_SairaChat_f9bb63a0_3:

    # mc "Allí teníamos una relación abierta. Ninguno de los dos hizo nada fuera de la relación, pero los dos aceptamos que el otro pudiera hacerlo."
    mc "We had an open relationship there. Neither of us did anything outside of the relationship, but we both accepted that the other one could do it."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1647
translate english c14s003_SairaChat_cf70031f_1:

    # mc "¿Serías capaz de volver a aceptar una relación así? Yo no."
    mc "Would you ever be able to accept a relationship like that again? I couldn't."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1649
translate english c14s003_SairaChat_eaa5a76a_1:

    # sai "Sabes por qué teniamos esa relación, ¿verdad?"
    sai "You know why we had that relationship, don't you?"

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1650
translate english c14s003_SairaChat_912763a7_1:

    # mc "Me gustaría escuchárlo de tus labios. En Portland diste unas razones, en la videoconferencia parecían otras."
    mc "I'd like to hear it from your lips. In Portland you gave some reasons, on the video conference they seemed different."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1652
translate english c14s003_SairaChat_1dc6138c_1:

    # sai "No me quería enamorar de ti."
    sai "I didn't want to fall in love with you."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1653
translate english c14s003_SairaChat_ab7574cb_1:

    # mc "Eso es una tontería, Saira..."
    mc "That's nonsense, Saira..."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1654
translate english c14s003_SairaChat_2b075ccb_1:

    # sai "No lo es. Si teníamos una relación así, no podía darte por seguro nunca. Si un día no venías a mi casa, podía pensar que estabas con otra..."
    sai "It's not. If we had a relationship like that, I could never be sure. If one day you didn't come to my house, I might think you were with someone else..."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1655
translate english c14s003_SairaChat_1cfa49b9_1:

    # mc "Nunca estuve con nadie más..."
    mc "I was never with anyone else..."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1656
translate english c14s003_SairaChat_5536a8f9_1:

    # sai "Lo sé. Si lo hubieras hecho me lo hubieras dicho."
    sai "I know. If you did you would have told me."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1658
translate english c14s003_SairaChat_4cc16176_1:

    # sai "Pero no funcionó."
    sai "But it didn't work."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1659
translate english c14s003_SairaChat_0e5ca576_1:

    # sai "Me enamoré hasta las trancas."
    sai "I fell in love to my heart's content."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1660
translate english c14s003_SairaChat_fbef191f_1:

    # sai "Y sólo me di cuenta cuando me dijiste que volvías aquí. Me di cuenta de que te perdía..."
    sai "And I only realised it when you told me you were coming back here. I realised I was losing you..."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1661
translate english c14s003_SairaChat_d13e3041_1:

    # mc "Y por alguna razón no quisiste formalizar la relación entonces."
    mc "And for some reason you didn't want to formalize the relationship then."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1663
translate english c14s003_SairaChat_636bcd9d_1:

    # sai "¡Porque hubiera sido injusto para ti, cabeza de chorlito!"
    sai "Because it would have been unfair to you, you pillock!"

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1664
translate english c14s003_SairaChat_692ea280_1:

    # mc "¿Para mí? ¿Por qué?"
    mc "For me? Why?"

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1666
translate english c14s003_SairaChat_c3683731_1:

    # sai "En ese momento no pensaba en transferirme. Solo pensaba en que te podía perder para siempre."
    sai "At that time I wasn't thinking about transferring. I was only thinking that I could lose you forever."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1667
translate english c14s003_SairaChat_5f0ccf6d_1:

    # sai "No quería tenerte esperando un año a que acabara la carrera."
    sai "I didn't want to keep you waiting a year for me to finish my degree."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1668
translate english c14s003_SairaChat_b59f3fdf_1:

    # sai "No sabía que había un curso de verano aquí que me podía ir bien. Que podríamos pasar el verano juntos."
    sai "I didn't know there was a summer course here that could suit me. That we could spend the summer together."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1669
translate english c14s003_SairaChat_77cc1467_1:

    # mc "Y decidiste apuntarte sin decirme nada."
    mc "And you decided to sign up without telling me."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1671
translate english c14s003_SairaChat_d8949939_1:

    # sai "Tenía que volver a India. Tenía que convencer a mis padres de que me dejasen cambiar de Universidad..."
    sai "I had to go back to India. I had to convince my parents to let me change universities..."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1672
translate english c14s003_SairaChat_d506710b_1:

    # sai "Cuando llegué a Goa... todo fue más fácil de lo que esperaba. Kalyani, mi prima, también empieza la Universidad este año, fue una aliada increíble."
    sai "When I arrived in Goa... everything was easier than I expected. Kalyani, my cousin, who is also starting university this year, was an amazing ally."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1673
translate english c14s003_SairaChat_ab224c65_1:

    # sai "Y creí que al menos mirarías los expedientes de las chicas que iban a vivir contigo... y que me llamarías."
    sai "And I thought you'd at least look at the files of the girls who were going to live with you... and call me."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1674
translate english c14s003_SairaChat_80920f3e_1:

    # mc "Sé que no es excusa, pero he estado muy ocupado, y de eso se ocupan [nor] y [mar]."
    mc "I know it's no excuse, but I've been very busy, and that's what [nor] and [mar] are taking care of."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1676
translate english c14s003_SairaChat_ace52d5d_1:

    # sai "Por eso te llamé desde Barcelona. No sabía si te habías enfadado o si no te habías enterado."
    sai "That's why I called you from Barcelona. I didn't know if you were angry or if you hadn't found out."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1677
translate english c14s003_SairaChat_cd6534e8_1:

    # mc "Y te dejaste la videoconferencia abierta..."
    mc "And you left the video conference open..."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1679
translate english c14s003_SairaChat_8565ad04_1:

    # sai "Y dije cosas que no debería haber dicho... sobre Eileen..."
    sai "And I said things I shouldn't have said... about Eileen..."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1681
translate english c14s003_SairaChat_3f631bb6_1:

    # mc "Lo sé. Por eso te pregunto ¿Serías capaz de volver a aceptar una relación abierta? Esta vez yo sí que estoy con alguien más..."
    mc "I know. That's why I'm asking you, would you be able to accept an open relationship again? This time I am with someone else..."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1683
translate english c14s003_SairaChat_3383f6ba_1:

    # mc "Lo sé. Por eso te pregunto ¿Realmente quieres una relación abierta?"
    mc "I know. That's why I'm asking you, do you really want an open relationship again?"

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1685
translate english c14s003_SairaChat_4dc809e9_1:

    # sai "No lo sé."
    sai "I don't know..."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1686
translate english c14s003_SairaChat_ef128114:

    # sai "Cuando me has besado en la mejilla en el aeropuerto todo ha parecido que... no sé... que se derrumbaba..."
    sai "When you kissed me on the cheek at the airport, everything seemed to... I don't know... to fall apart..."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1688
translate english c14s003_SairaChat_1e2c5f92:

    # sai "Cuando me he enterado que estás con alguien... todo se ha roto... no sé como explicarlo..."
    sai "When I found out that you're with someone... everything broke... I don't know how to explain it..."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1689
translate english c14s003_SairaChat_731785bc:

    # mc "Si volvieramos a estar juntos, sería la misma relación que tú quisiste tener en Portland."
    mc "If we were to get back together, it would be the same relationship you wanted to have in Portland."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1691
translate english c14s003_SairaChat_e27ec76d_1:

    # sai "Por supuesto que te quiero para mí sola, pero llevo un mes pensando en si estarías con Eileen o no..."
    sai "Of course I want you all to myself, but I've been thinking for a month whether you'd be with Eileen or not..."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1692
translate english c14s003_SairaChat_0a7f8572_1:

    # mc "No lo estoy. Ni con nadie."
    mc "I'm not. Or with anyone."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1694
translate english c14s003_SairaChat_3ec6fcaa:

    # sai "Lo sé. Pero en Portland sabía... creía... que no ibas a estar con nadie. No eres de los que se acuestan con la primera que pasa si no sientes nada por ella..."
    sai "I know. But in Portland I knew... I thought... you weren't going to be with anyone. You're not the type to sleep with the first girl who comes along if you don't have feelings for her..."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1696
translate english c14s003_SairaChat_fdeb9d69:

    # mc "Saira, si estoy con alguien más, es porque estoy tan enamorado de ella como lo estaba de ti."
    mc "Saira, if I'm with someone else, it's because I'm as much in love with her as I was with you."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1698
translate english c14s003_SairaChat_a0409f27:

    # mc "Saira, si estuviera con alguien más, sería porque estaría tan enamorado de ella como lo estaba de ti."
    mc "Saira, if I were with anyone else, it would be because I would be as much in love with her as I was with you."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1699
translate english c14s003_SairaChat_d979491f_1:

    # mc "Pero no lo estoy. Eso es lo importante."
    mc "But I'm not. That's the important thing."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1701
translate english c14s003_SairaChat_20073a44:

    # sai "{b}¿Qué?{/b} ¿Estabas?"
    sai "{b}What?{/b} You were?"

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1702
translate english c14s003_SairaChat_374f7d97:

    # mc "Mi vida se ha complicado mucho... tengo muchos frentes abiertos ahora mismo, y no solo a nivel amoroso."
    mc "My life has become very complicated... I have a lot of open fronts right now, and not just on a romantic level."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1703
translate english c14s003_SairaChat_15fb09dd:

    # mc "Verte, pese a que lo esperaba después de la video conferencia, no ha dejado de ser una sorpresa."
    mc "Seeing you, even though I expected it after the video conference, was still a surprise."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1705
translate english c14s003_SairaChat_bafdea0d:

    # sai "¿Puedo al menos abrazarte ahora?"
    sai "Can I at least hug you now?"

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1706
translate english c14s003_SairaChat_801d760a:

    # mc "No necesitas pedir permiso para eso..."
    mc "You don't need to ask permission for that..."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1708
translate english c14s003_SairaChat_58697b7b:

    # sai "Te he echado de menos..."
    sai "I missed you..."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1709
translate english c14s003_SairaChat_30c6515a:

    # mc "Y yo a ti..."
    mc "And I missed you..."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1710
translate english c14s003_SairaChat_15b67a9e:

    # mc "Pero tenemos que hablar de muchas cosas, analizar cómo nos sentimos. ¿Te importa si nos tomamos un tiempo antes de tomar alguna decisión?"
    mc "But we need to talk about a lot of things, analyze how we feel. Do you mind if we take some time before we make any decisions?"

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1712
translate english c14s003_SairaChat_eac236a2:

    # sai "Creo que será lo mejor. Hoy ha sido una montaña rusa de emociones. No me esperaba del todo esta recepción..."
    sai "I think it will be for the best. Today has been a rollercoaster of emotions. I wasn't expecting this reception at all..."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1713
translate english c14s003_SairaChat_6798e84f:

    # sai "Realmente no sé lo que me esperaba..."
    sai "I really don't know what I was expecting..."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1714
translate english c14s003_SairaChat_f0ee1de0:

    # mc "¿Te han dicho lo de mañana en la playa? Podemos volver a hablar si quieres..."
    mc "Did they tell you about the beach trip tomorrow? We can talk again if you want..."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1716
translate english c14s003_SairaChat_1e1f9647:

    # sai "Sí, me lo han dicho. Pero de hoy a mañana no creo que cambie mucho. Hay muchas cosas que tenemos que hablar y..."
    sai "Yes, I have been told. But from now to tomorrow I don't think much will change. There are a lot of things we need to talk about and..."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1718
translate english c14s003_SairaChat_dd0461ef_1:

    # "*Knock-Knock*"
    "*Knock-Knock*"

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1719
translate english c14s003_SairaChat_5333b42a:

    # emm "Soy yo."
    emm "It's me."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1720
translate english c14s003_SairaChat_800fe78d:

    # mc "Pasa, [emm]."
    mc "Come in, [emm]"

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1723
translate english c14s003_SairaChat_d9028d82:

    # emm "¡Oops! No sabía que {b}ésta{/b} estaba aquí..."
    emm "Oops! I didn't know {b}this one{/b} was here..."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1726
translate english c14s003_SairaChat_b1e27bb6:

    # emm "¡Oops! No sabía que estabas acompañado..."
    emm "Oops! I didn't know you had company..."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1727
translate english c14s003_SairaChat_697763a5:

    # mc "¿Querías algo?"
    mc "Did you need anything?"

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1728
translate english c14s003_SairaChat_6f551207:

    # emm "Sí, la cena está casi lista. Mamá me ha dicho que te avise."
    emm "Yes, dinner is almost ready. Mom told me to let you know."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1730
translate english c14s003_SairaChat_7823a63e:

    # mc "Ya seguiremos hablando mañana, Saira."
    mc "We'll continue talking tomorrow, Saira."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1731
translate english c14s003_SairaChat_37aac704:

    # sai "Genial. ¿Hablamos en la playa?"
    sai "Great. Shall we talk at the beach?"

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1732
translate english c14s003_SairaChat_de4d03e5:

    # mc "Perfecto."
    mc "Great."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1735
translate english c14s003_SairaChat_9d9029ba:

    # emm "*Gruñido*"
    emm "*Growl*"

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1737
translate english c14s003_SairaChat_f8abbbc5:

    # "Pasáis una agradable noche en familia, una familia a la que se ha añadido Scarlett. Kiara y Eileen se unen a vosotros en la cena. A este paso tendréis que comprar una mesa más grande."
    "You spend a pleasant evening as a family, a family to which Scarlett has been added. Kiara and Eileen join you for dinner. At this rate you'll have to buy a bigger table."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1738
translate english c14s003_SairaChat_d7153543:

    # "Eileen está en su salsa, hablando con toda la familia, a la que conoce desde hace años y poniéndose al día con todo el mundo."
    "Eileen is in her element, talking to the whole family, whom she has known for years, and catching up with everyone."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1739
translate english c14s003_SairaChat_cafcc8ce:

    # "Scarlett, [mar], y [nor] intentan integrar a Kiara en la conversación. Se la ve un poco desubicada. No está acostumbrada a una familia así, ni a cenas llenas de risas."
    "Scarlett, [mar], and [nor] try to integrate Kiara into the conversation. She looks a little out of place. She's not used to a family like this, nor to dinners full of laughs."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1740
translate english c14s003_SairaChat_b5ea1e09:

    # "No se habla de ninguno de los temas escabrosos del día. Es el momento de dejarlos atrás."
    "None of the lurid topics of the day are discussed. It's time to put them behind you."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1743
translate english c14s004_ToTheBeach_0bd072a9:

    # centered "{size=+20}{b}DÍA 16 – MIÉRCOLES{/b}{/size}"
    centered "{size=+20}{b}DAY 16 - WEDNESDAY{/b}{/size}"

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1744
translate english c14s004_ToTheBeach_8e894ef2:

    # "El día siguiente es un torbellino de actividad."
    "The next day is a whirlwind of activity."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1746
translate english c14s004_ToTheBeach_d1affad6:

    # "Acabar de preparar la comida... aunque unas colaboran más que otras..."
    "Finish preparing the food... although some collaborate more than others..."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1747
translate english c14s004_ToTheBeach_6c87b493:

    # "Kate y Betty se dedican a aligerar la carga. Después dirán que así había menos cosas que bajar a los coches."
    "Kate and Betty are all about lightening the load. Later they'll say there was less stuff to bring down to the cars thanks to them."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1749
translate english c14s004_ToTheBeach_8c67420c:

    # "Coger todos los artilugios de playa... Habiendo una piscina, ¿quién quiere ir a la playa? Lleváis años sin pisar la playa, al menos en familia."
    "Take all the beach gadgets... With a pool, who wants to go to the beach? You haven't set foot on the beach in years, at least as a family."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1750
translate english c14s004_ToTheBeach_9c8b13ca:

    # "Casi todo el mundo tiene buena parte del día libre hoy, con lo que es el día perfecto."
    "Almost everyone has a good chunk of the day off today, making it the perfect day."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1751
translate english c14s004_ToTheBeach_c6b7c512:

    # "Subirlo todo a los coches... Todo el mundo colabora con lo que puede."
    "Getting everything into the cars... Everyone cooperates as much as they can."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1752
translate english c14s004_ToTheBeach_250f2cca:

    # "Si ayer parecíais una familia subiendo las cosas de Scarlett a su habitación, hoy lo sois."
    "If yesterday you looked like a family bringing Scarlett's things up to her room, today you are. You still don't know it, but you are."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1754
translate english c14s004_ToTheBeach_db3ce6bd:

    # "Incluso Lisa y Saira colaboran antes de ir a la universidad. Esperan llegar para comer a la playa y unirse a la celebración navideña."
    "Even Lisa and Saira help out before going to college. They look forward to arriving for lunch at the beach and joining in the Christmas meal."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1755
translate english c14s004_ToTheBeach_37795a13:

    # "Kim y Debbie tienen clase por la tarde. Kate se va a saltar sus clases, demasiado cercanas a la hora de comer, y prefiere pasar el día con la familia. La Familia."
    "Kim and Debbie have class in the afternoon. Kate is going to skip her classes, too close to lunchtime, and she would rather spend the day with the family. The Family."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1757
translate english c14s004_ToTheBeach_3331e286:

    # "Llevas a Lisa y Saira a la universidad antes de ir a volver a casa a recoger un nuevo cargamento de chicas. 16 personas viviendo en casa y solo tres coches..."
    "You take Lisa and Saira to college before you go back home to pick up a new shipment of girls. Sixteen people living at home and only three cars..."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1759
translate english c14s004_ToTheBeach_f36417c1:

    # "Por fin llegáis a la playa. Samantha y Simone se unirán más tarde. Jamaal no va a poder venir. Algo sobre una indigestión por comer demasiadas empanadas."
    "You finally arrive at the beach. Samantha and Simone will join you later. Jamaal won't be able to make it. Something about indigestion from eating too many empanadas."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1761
translate english c14s004_ToTheBeach_556f62c9:

    # "Vas al chiringuito a mear antes de descargar las cosas."
    "You go to the beach bar to pee before you unload the stuff."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1767
translate english c14s004_ToTheBeach_2f9ef6e7:

    # mc "¿Os ayudo a algo con la comida?"
    mc "Can I help you with the food?"

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1768
translate english c14s004_ToTheBeach_265dec31:

    # mom "No hace falta. Estos son los últimos túpers y comeremos en el merendero. Las mujeres vamos a quedarnos poniéndonos morenas mientras las chicas juegan en el agua."
    mom "No need. These are the last of the lunchboxes. We'll eat in the picnic area. We women are going to stay and get a tan while the girls play in the water."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1769
translate english c14s004_ToTheBeach_6f7e40ce:

    # mc "Déjame al menos llevarlos hasta las sombrillas."
    mc "Let me at least take them to the parasols."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1771
translate english c14s004_ToTheBeach_d2410ecc:

    # mom "Supongo que no te apetece tumbarte con nosotras a tomar el sol..."
    mom "I guess you don't feel like lying in the sun with us..."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1772
translate english c14s004_ToTheBeach_13d6ddcb:

    # mc "Yo me quedaría, pero sabes que me aburro muchísimo estando tirado en la toalla estilo lagarto sin hacer nada."
    mc "I'd stay, but you know I get bored as hell lying on the towel lizard style doing nothing."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1774
translate english c14s004_ToTheBeach_ec8e90a6:

    # mom "Lo sé, cariño. ¿Por qué no ayudas a Betty con las sillas?"
    mom "I know, sweetheart. Why don't you help Betty with the loungers?"

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1775
translate english c14s004_ToTheBeach_c5a461a2:

    # mc "¡Dejo los túpers en las toallas y voy! Te quiero."
    mc "I'll leave the lunchboxes under the parasols and I'm on my way! I love you."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1781
translate english c14s004_ToTheBeach_e3a28ce2:

    # mc "Tía Betty, vengo a ayudarte con las sillas."
    mc "Aunt Betty, I'm here to help you with the chairs."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1782
translate english c14s004_ToTheBeach_a11984a4:

    # bet "No hace falta, cielo. Ya casi las he llevado todas con la ayuda de las chicas."
    bet "No need, honey. I've almost carried them all with the girls' help."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1783
translate english c14s004_ToTheBeach_259650b3:

    # mc "Por cierto, ¿ese es el modelo de bikini oficial del Vaticano? Lo veo... demasiado sexy, ¿no?"
    mc "By the way, is that the official Vatican bikini model? It looks... too sexy, doesn't it?"

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1785
translate english c14s004_ToTheBeach_0b68c78b:

    # bet "*Risa* ¿Sexy yo? Hay que llevarte a que te revisen la vista."
    bet "*Laugh* Sexy? I? You need to get your eyesight checked."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1786
translate english c14s004_ToTheBeach_ef0aa9bc:

    # bet "Es un antiguo bañador de [nor], de cuando se estaba adelgazando. Es en el único bañador que cabía yo."
    bet "It's an old bikini of [nor]'s, from when she was getting thinner. It's the only swimsuit I could fit in."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1787
translate english c14s004_ToTheBeach_ae2004ef:

    # mc "Tenemos que renovarte el vestuario. No puedes ir con el hábito a todas partes"
    mc "We have to renew your wardrobe. You can't go everywhere in the habit."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1789
translate english c14s004_ToTheBeach_4798ee20:

    # bet "Tienes razón... debería comprarme más ropa... el hábito..."
    bet "You're right... I should buy more clothes... the habit..."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1790
translate english c14s004_ToTheBeach_fef0f016:

    # bet "El hábito no lo puedo usar para todo..."
    bet "I can't use the habit for everything..."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1791
translate english c14s004_ToTheBeach_184a4ec8:

    # mc "Betty, ¿ha pasado algo?"
    mc "Betty, did something happen?"

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1793
translate english c14s004_ToTheBeach_d10afe80:

    # bet "No, nada... ¿puedes ir a ayudar a Olivia con la sombrilla? Ya me ocupo yo de llevar el resto de las sillas."
    bet "No, nothing... Can you go help Olivia with the parasol? I'll take care of carrying the rest of the chairs."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1794
translate english c14s004_ToTheBeach_9e97d52f:

    # mc "¡Voy! Te quiero."
    mc "On my way! I love you."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1800
translate english c14s004_ToTheBeach_dd3acbb4:

    # mee "¿Quieres algo, cariño?"
    mee "Do you need anything, sweetie?"

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1801
translate english c14s004_ToTheBeach_c27ed1f7:

    # mc "Tía Betty me ha enviado a que te ayude con la sombrilla."
    mc "Aunt Betty sent me to help you with the parasol."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1803
translate english c14s004_ToTheBeach_0bfa1458:

    # mee "Gracias, cielo, pero la acabo de derrotar una vez ha parado el viento."
    mee "Thank you, sweetie, but once the wind stopped, I just defeated it. It wasn't a rival for me."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1804
translate english c14s004_ToTheBeach_e539c887:

    # mc "Casi parecías una stripper cogida a esa barra. *Risa*"
    mc "You almost looked like a stripper holding that bar. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1806
translate english c14s004_ToTheBeach_e10117ec:

    # mee "¡[mc]!"
    mee "[mc]!"

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1807
translate english c14s004_ToTheBeach_e81ee9a0:

    # mc "Perdona, me estoy empezando a sentir un poco inútil y eso me frustra. Parece que no me necesitáis para nada."
    mc "Sorry, I'm starting to feel a little useless and it's frustrating me. You guys don't seem to need me for anything."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1809
translate english c14s004_ToTheBeach_c6302da7:

    # mee "Cariño, estás rodeado de mujeres que no te han visto en años. No voy a decir que no te necesitemos, siempre te necesitaremos, pero sabemos apañarnos solas."
    mee "Sweetie, you're surrounded by women who haven't seen you in a couple of years. I'm not going to say we don't need you, we'll always need you, but we know how to manage on our own."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1810
translate english c14s004_ToTheBeach_4d554932:

    # mc "No es que me ayudes mucho. *Risa*"
    mc "Not that you're much help. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1812
translate english c14s004_ToTheBeach_2f73b4e3:

    # mee "Ven que te de un abrazo. Esto seguro que ayuda."
    mee "Come here and let me hug you. That is sure to help."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1813
translate english c14s004_ToTheBeach_8736c3dc:

    # mc "Por supuesto que sí, Meemaw."
    mc "Of course, Meemaw."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1815
translate english c14s004_ToTheBeach_53993a4a:

    # mee "Deberías ir a ayudar a [nor]. Está trayendo las neveras."
    mee "You should go help [nor]. She is bringing in the ice boxes."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1816
translate english c14s004_ToTheBeach_ff6d8cc3:

    # mc "¿Las? ¿En plural? ¡Voy! Te quiero."
    mc "Iceboxes? Plural? On my way! I love you."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1822
translate english c14s004_ToTheBeach_0d183e14:

    # mc "¿Qué haces llevando eso?"
    mc "What are you doing carrying that?"

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1823
translate english c14s004_ToTheBeach_901b11db:

    # nor "Solo son un par de neveras, cielo."
    nor "It's just a couple of iceboxes, sweetie."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1825
translate english c14s004_ToTheBeach_7589425b:

    # mc "En tu estado no deberías llevar ni una. Ya las llevo yo."
    mc "In your condition you shouldn't be carrying even one. Let me carry them for you."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1827
translate english c14s004_ToTheBeach_0d3062b0:

    # nor "Aún no sabemos nada. Todavía faltan días para que sea fiable, y no me voy a quedar parada por si acaso..."
    nor "We don't know anything yet. It's still days before it's reliable, and I'm not going to stand still just in case..."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1828
translate english c14s004_ToTheBeach_6c000576:

    # mc "¿Prefieres arriesgarte? Ahora me vas a decir que también vas a beber vino en la comida..."
    mc "Would you rather take the risk? Now you're going to tell me you're going to drink wine at lunch too?"

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1830
translate english c14s004_ToTheBeach_4b5863fb:

    # nor "No pensaba hacerlo. Ya viste en la cena de anoche que sólo bebí agua. Pese a las miradas raras de [mar]."
    nor "I wasn't planning to. I only drank water at dinner last night. Despite the weird looks from [mar]."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1831
translate english c14s004_ToTheBeach_ea865f30:

    # mc "Lo ví..."
    mc "I know..."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1833
translate english c14s004_ToTheBeach_c2e72cf2:

    # nor "Aunque para hoy le pedí a [mar] que comprara cava sin alcohol, con la excusa de que era para que las chicas también puedan brindar."
    nor "Although for today I asked [mar] to buy some non-alcoholic cava, with the excuse that it was so that the girls could also toast."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1835
translate english c14s004_ToTheBeach_08960e01:

    # mc "¿Sólo? ¿Te parecen pocas? ¿Qué llevas ahí? Ya las llevo yo."
    mc "Only two? Do you think one isn't enough? What are you carrying? I'll carry them for you."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1837
translate english c14s004_ToTheBeach_af9900ac:

    # nor "¡No soy una floja! Solo son las bebidas. Las neveras con la comida se las han llevado las chicas."
    nor "I'm not a pushover! It's just the drinks. The girls took the iceboxes with the food in them."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1838
translate english c14s004_ToTheBeach_5974f1ca:

    # mc "Y ¿necesitamos dos neveras para la bebida?"
    mc "And do we need two iceboxes only for drinks?"

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1840
translate english c14s004_ToTheBeach_a5536b1e:

    # nor "Todo el mundo bebe cosas diferentes. Esta vez incluso tenemos cava sin alcohol para que las chicas también puedan brindar."
    nor "Everyone drinks different things. This time we even have non-alcoholic cava so the girls can toast too."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1841
translate english c14s004_ToTheBeach_dc142a17:

    # mc "[nor], las chicas ya tienen 18, pueden beber alcohol si quieren. Y lo hacen..."
    mc "[nor], the girls are already 18, they can drink alcohol if they want to. And they do..."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1843
translate english c14s004_ToTheBeach_8d810fe4:

    # nor "Lo sé, pero hoy no van a controlar cuanto beben, entre la comida y los brindis... Es Navidad. *Risa*"
    nor "I know, but today they're not going to control how much they drink, between the food and the toasts... It's Christmas. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1844
translate english c14s004_ToTheBeach_83fcaf3d:

    # mc "Me parece una buena excusa para tener cava sin alcohol. Bien pensado."
    mc "Sounds like a good excuse to have non-alcoholic cava. Good thinking."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1846
translate english c14s004_ToTheBeach_7e8b81ce:

    # nor "Puedes dejar las neveras bajo la sombrilla. Yo iré a por la crema al coche."
    nor "You can leave the coolers under the parasol. I'll go get the sunscreen from the car."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1847
translate english c14s004_ToTheBeach_21611b89:

    # mc "¿Algo más en lo que pueda ayudar?"
    mc "Anything else I can help with?"

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1849
translate english c14s004_ToTheBeach_993fa1c4:

    # nor "No, creo que ya está todo... a menos que quieras ponernos crema solar a todas las que nos quedamos en las toallas."
    nor "No, I think that's it... unless you want to put sunscreen on all of us who are staying in chairs."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1852
translate english c14s004_ToTheBeach_692cf86c:

    # nor "Aunque ya sabemos como acaba eso cuando tú estás cerca..."
    nor "Although we know how that ends when you're around..."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1853
translate english c14s004_ToTheBeach_90d27dbf:

    # mc "Mejor voy a pasar, por lo que pueda ser."
    mc "I'd better pass, for what it may be."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1855
translate english c14s004_ToTheBeach_da704a7d:

    # mc "Si queréis, por mí ningún problema."
    mc "If you want, that's fine with me."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1857
translate english c14s004_ToTheBeach_21a8ed60:

    # nor "Lo estaba diciendo en broma, cielo. Estando cinco mujeres aquí, sería raro que nos pusieras la crema tú, ¿no?"
    nor "I was joking, sweetheart. With five women there, it would be weird if you put the sunscreen on us, wouldn't it?"

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1858
translate english c14s004_ToTheBeach_961acb0b:

    # nor "Puedes ir con las chicas. Iban a jugar a algo en el agua."
    nor "You can go with the girls. They were going to play something in the water."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1859
translate english c14s004_ToTheBeach_9e97d52f_1:

    # mc "¡Voy! Te quiero."
    mc "On my way! I love you."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1865
translate english c14s004_ToTheBeach_91d1ec52:

    # mc "¡Oh, Kiara! No te había visto desde que hemos llegado. Te sienta bien ese bañador."
    mc "Oh, Kiara! I haven't seen you since we arrived. You look good in that bikini."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1866
translate english c14s004_ToTheBeach_e2f5f514:

    # kia "Gracias, [mc]. Estaba ayudando a Betty con las sillas. Te he visto irte en dirección a Olivia."
    kia "Thank you, [mc]. I was helping Betty with the chairs. I saw you leaving in Olivia's direction."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1867
translate english c14s004_ToTheBeach_f1423be7:

    # mc "Ahora me siento más inutil todavía. Me ha dicho que no necesitaba mi ayuda..."
    mc "Now I feel even more useless. She told me she didn't need my help..."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1869
translate english c14s004_ToTheBeach_0b1690b6:

    # kia "La mía tampoco, pero como me tratan entre algodones, no ha podido negarse a que la ayudara. *Risa*"
    kia "She didn't need my help either, but since they treat me like I'm going to break, she couldn't refuse my help. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1870
translate english c14s004_ToTheBeach_926f1d6e:

    # mc "¿Cómo está el brazo?"
    mc "How's your arm?"

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1872
translate english c14s004_ToTheBeach_bebf42ef:

    # kia "Duele menos, pero aún duele un poco. El ungüento que me dió Samantha es fantástico."
    kia "It's a bit better, but it still hurts a little. The ointment Samantha gave me is fantastic."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1873
translate english c14s004_ToTheBeach_57a3ab27:

    # mc "Eso está genial."
    mc "That's great to hear."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1874
translate english c14s004_ToTheBeach_8cd57a4a:

    # mc "¿Estáis a gusto en casa de [nor]? Si no, podéis volver a mi cama."
    mc "Are you comfortable at [nor]'s house? If not, you can go back to my bed."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1876
translate english c14s004_ToTheBeach_51e9bce6:

    # kia "No te preocupes, la casa es fantástica y [nor] nos está tratando increíblemente bien."
    kia "Don't worry, the house is fantastic and [nor] is treating us incredibly well."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1877
translate english c14s004_ToTheBeach_71778941:

    # kia "De lo que tengo ganas es de que llegue mañana para poder ir a casa a por más ropa. El bikini me lo ha dejado [emm], era la talla más parecida a la mía, aunque sea mucho más alta."
    kia "What I'm looking forward to is tomorrow so I can go home and get more clothes. [emm] lent me this bikini, it was the closest size to mine, even though she's much taller."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1878
translate english c14s004_ToTheBeach_7f758d2f:

    # mc "No tengas prisa. Hoy vuelve Alexia a Newport. A ver si puede acompañarnos mañana. De uniforme a ser posible."
    mc "Don't be in a hurry. Alexia is returning to Newport today. Let's see if she can join us tomorrow. In uniform if possible."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1880
translate english c14s004_ToTheBeach_ce0c5779:

    # kia "No creo que sea necesario. Solomon no estará."
    kia "I don't think it's necessary. Solomon won't be there."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1881
translate english c14s004_ToTheBeach_f3f60e1e:

    # mc "De todas formas se lo pediré. Yo si que os acompañaré, deberéis cargar las cosas en la camioneta."
    mc "I'll ask her anyway. I will accompany you; you will have to load the stuff in the pickup truck."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1883
translate english c14s004_ToTheBeach_379072c5:

    # kia "¿Te importa si lo hablamos mañana? Prefiero no pensar en eso hasta que llegue el momento... Volver a mi propia casa como si fuera una ladrona..."
    kia "Do you mind if we talk about it tomorrow? I'd rather not think about it until the time comes... Going back to my own house like I'm a thief..."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1884
translate english c14s004_ToTheBeach_19016501:

    # mc "No te preocupes. Lo hablamos mañana. Ven aquí."
    mc "Don't worry. We'll talk about it tomorrow. Come here."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1886
translate english c14s004_ToTheBeach_766b6a11:

    # kia "Gracias, [mc]. Por todo. Por acogernos en tu familia y por ayudarnos."
    kia "Thank you, [mc]. For everything. For welcoming us into your family and for helping us."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1887
translate english c14s004_ToTheBeach_37d11dea:

    # mc "No le des más vueltas. Es Navidad. *Risa*"
    mc "Don't think about it too much. It's Christmas. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1889
translate english c14s004_ToTheBeach_19de8534:

    # kia "Bueno, voy a sentarme bajo la sombrilla. Pelirroja y blanca de piel es receta para quemarme."
    kia "Well, I'm going to sit under the umbrella. White skinned redhead is a recipe for getting burned."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1890
translate english c14s004_ToTheBeach_3699eb23:

    # mc "Perfecto, nos vemos luego."
    mc "Great, see you later."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1896
translate english c14s004_ToTheBeach_4a9931ba:

    # mc "Hey, [dap]. ¿Donde vas con esa pelota?"
    mc "Hey, [dap]. Where are you going with that ball?"

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1897
translate english c14s004_ToTheBeach_479536e4:

    # dap "Kate nos ha convencido a para jugar al juego aquel que explicó en la piscina el otro día. El parecido a Verdad o Reto con la pelota"
    dap "Kate has convinced us to play the game she explained in the pool the other day. The Truth or Dare look-alike with the ball."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:1898
translate english c14s004_ToTheBeach_e0f67ad6:

    # mc "Recuerda cómo acabó la última vez que jugamos... no demasiado bien."
