# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3323
translate english c14s006_Christmas_164be0b6:

    # eil "[eri] nos dijo que no nos sorprendiéramos si [emm] intentaba enfrentarnos hoy de alguna forma."
    eil "[eri] told us not to be surprised if [emm] tried to confront us today in any way."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3325
translate english c14s006_Christmas_3824816c:

    # eil "{i}(Y ahora que sé que está contigo, la entiendo perfectamente. Si peleábamos delante tuyo nos ridiculizaríamos a nosotras mismas.){/i}"
    eil "{i}(And now that I know she's with you, I understand her perfectly. If we fought in front of you we would ridicule ourselves.){/i}"

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3326
translate english c14s006_Christmas_726c3f15:

    # eil "Supongo que tener a dos ex-novias en la misma comida navideña podía ser un riesgo."
    eil "I guess having two ex-girlfriends at the same holiday lunch could be a risk."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3328
translate english c14s006_Christmas_076eb4a7:

    # sai "¿Ya no soy la follamiga? *Risa* ¿He ascendido a ex-novia?"
    sai "I'm not the fuckfriend anymore? *Laugh* Have I been promoted to ex-girlfriend?"

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3330
translate english c14s006_Christmas_b8cfd6a9:

    # sai "Después de lo que dijo [eri], Eileen y yo estuvimos hablando largo y tendido."
    sai "After what [eri] said, Eileen and I talked at length."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3332
translate english c14s006_Christmas_aa265f5d:

    # sai "Tú me habías dicho que estabas con Eileen. Era raro estar hablando con ella en la piscina, después de un mes comiéndome la cabeza."
    sai "You told me you were with Eileen. It was weird to be talking to her at the pool, after a month of thinking about it."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3334
translate english c14s006_Christmas_d4423745:

    # sai "Tú me habías dicho que no habías vuelto con Eileen, pero era raro estar hablando con ella en la piscina después de un mes comiéndome la cabeza."
    sai "You told me you didn't go back to Eileen, but it was weird to be talking to her in the pool after a month of thinking about it."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3336
translate english c14s006_Christmas_234e5c34:

    # eil "Empezamos como dos perras celosas, especialmente Saira, y acabamos contándonos los mejores momentos que hemos pasado contigo."
    eil "We started out as two jealous bitches, especially Saira, and ended up telling each other about the best times we've had with you."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3338
translate english c14s006_Christmas_340c7610:

    # eil "Parece que vuelves a estar con las dos... sí, a Saira se le escapó. Haces bien, Saira será una buena incorporación al harén."
    eil "Looks like you're back with both of us... yes, Saira spilled the beans. It's fine, Saira will be a good addition to the harem."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3340
translate english c14s006_Christmas_96103bf0:

    # eil "Parece que vuestro reencuentro fue más frío que el nuestro, pero deberías pensártelo. Saira sería una buena incorporación al harén."
    eil "It looks like your reunion was colder than ours, but you should think about it. Saira would be a good addition to the harem."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3342
translate english c14s006_Christmas_8147fbdd:

    # eil "Parece que vuestro reencuentro no fue tan frío como el nuestro... sí, a Saira se le escapó. Haces bien, Saira será una buena incorporación al harén."
    eil "It looks like your reunion was not as cold as ours... yes, Saira spilled the beans. It's fine, Saira will make a fine addition to the harem."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3344
translate english c14s006_Christmas_16813b17:

    # eil "Parece que nuestros reencuentros contigo fueron igual de frío, pero deberías pensártelo. Saira sería una buena incorporación al harén."
    eil "It seems our reunions with you were just as cold, but you should think about it. Saira would be a good addition to the harem."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3345
translate english c14s006_Christmas_583e6a89:

    # mc "¿Qué? ¿Le has dicho lo del harén?"
    mc "What? Have you told her about the harem?"

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3347
translate english c14s006_Christmas_ef0f64a8:

    # mc "No hay harén, solo estoy saliendo con Saira."
    mc "There's no harem. I'm only dating Saira."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3350
translate english c14s006_Christmas_0a11ba44:

    # mc "No hay harén, solo estoy saliendo contigo."
    mc "There's no harem. I'm only dating you."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3352
translate english c14s006_Christmas_a8320589:

    # mc "No hay harén, solo estoy saliendo con una chica."
    mc "There's no harem. I'm only dating one girl."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3354
translate english c14s006_Christmas_e1841300:

    # sai "Después de hablar bastante rato..."
    sai "After talking for a while..."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3356
translate english c14s006_Christmas_1e128303:

    # sai "Nos dimos cuenta de que si estás con las dos es porque te metimos en la cabeza la relación abierta y el haren."
    sai "We realised that if you are with both of us it's because we put the ideas of open relationship and harem in your head."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3358
translate english c14s006_Christmas_62551a4f:

    # sai "Nos dimos cuenta de que si estás con Eileen y yo puedo tener una oportunidad, es porque te metimos en la cabeza la relación abierta y el haren."
    sai "We realised that if you're with Eileen and I can have a chance, it's because we put the ideas of open relationship and harem in your head."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3361
translate english c14s006_Christmas_d23144e1:

    # sai "Me dí cuenta que Eileen proponiendote el harén, quizá me haya dado la oportunidad que necesitaba para volver contigo."
    sai "I realised that Eileen proposing the harem to you may have given me the opportunity I needed to get back together with you."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3363
translate english c14s006_Christmas_6fd24c25:

    # sai "Me dí cuenta que Eileen proponiendote el harén, quizá me de la oportunidad que necesitaba para volver contigo en el futuro."
    sai "I realised that Eileen proposing the harem to you might give me the chance I needed to get back together with you in the future."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3365
translate english c14s006_Christmas_56102810:

    # sai "Después nos pasamos un rato riendo." (multiple=2)
    sai "Afterwards we spent some time laughing." (multiple=2)

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3366
translate english c14s006_Christmas_bf25048c:

    # eil "Y comparando notas. *Risa*" (multiple=2)
    eil "And comparing notes. *Laugh*" (multiple=2)

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3367
translate english c14s006_Christmas_3c1a15a5:

    # sai "Descubrimos que no somos rivales." (multiple=2)
    sai "We discovered that we are not rivals." (multiple=2)

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3368
translate english c14s006_Christmas_12db876d:

    # eil "Y decidimos hacernos amigas." (multiple=2)
    eil "And we decided to become friends." (multiple=2)

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3370
translate english c14s006_Christmas_f9ce5a32:

    # eil "Saira no podía creerse que [emm] fuera a intentar algo como lo que ha hecho, pero yo la conozco mejor."
    eil "Saira couldn't believe that [emm] was going to try something like what she has done, but I know her better."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3372
translate english c14s006_Christmas_7dad870f:

    # sai "Traté poco con ella ayer, parecía enfadada, pero creía que tenía que ver con la situación de Scarlett."
    sai "I spoke to her a bit yesterday, she seemed angry, but I thought it was to do with Scarlett's situation. She seemed nice."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3374
translate english c14s006_Christmas_e55bb51d:

    # sai "Traté poco con ella ayer, parecía una chica muy agradable."
    sai "I spoke to her a little yesterday, she seemed like a very nice girl."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3375
translate english c14s006_Christmas_e29c8e39:

    # mc "Es muy agradable... cuando quiere. Supongo que querrá después de que le de unos azotes. *Risa*"
    mc "She's very nice... when she wants to be. I guess she'll want to after I spank her. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3377
translate english c14s006_Christmas_2a35a010:

    # eil "Déjale creer que nos hemos peleado. Será una pequeña victoria en su cabeza."
    eil "Let her believe that we had a fight. It will be a small victory in her head."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3378
translate english c14s006_Christmas_11c00290:

    # sai "Y nos dará tiempo de planear nuestra venganza. *Risa*"
    sai "And it will give us time to plan our revenge. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3379
translate english c14s006_Christmas_2891af26:

    # mc "Haced que parezca un accidente. Por allí viene la última invitada y sospecharía enseguida de vosotras."
    mc "Make it look like an accident. Here comes the last guest and she'd be suspicious of you right away."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3385
translate english c14s006_Christmas_00d216ac:

    # mc "Alexia, ven. Quiero presentarte a alguien."
    mc "Alexia, come. I want to introduce you to someone."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3386
translate english c14s006_Christmas_14e3d577:

    # mc "Alexia, Saira. Saira, Alexia."
    mc "Alexia, Saira. Saira, Alexia."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3388
translate english c14s006_Christmas_8777e192:

    # oma "Encantada de conocerte, Saira. ¿Eres la última estudiante?"
    oma "Nice to meet you, Saira. Are you the last student?"

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3389
translate english c14s006_Christmas_042239fa:

    # sai "Sí, llegué ayer. ¿Eres amiga de la familia?"
    sai "Yes, I arrived yesterday. Are you a family friend?"

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3390
translate english c14s006_Christmas_fe99e360:

    # oma "Más o menos. He tenido que ayudar a [mc] en algunas cosas."
    oma "Sort of. I've had to help [mc] with some things."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3391
translate english c14s006_Christmas_874d55fb:

    # oma "Hola, Eileen. Tenemos que hablar."
    oma "Hello, Eileen. We need to talk."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3393
translate english c14s006_Christmas_a68d3962:

    # mc "¿Qué tal el viaje, Alexia?"
    mc "How was your trip, Alexia?"

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3394
translate english c14s006_Christmas_f915a04a:

    # oma "Muy pesado, pero al menos ya estoy aquí."
    oma "Tiresome, but at least I finally arrived."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3395
translate english c14s006_Christmas_716d306f:

    # oma "Me tienes que contar qué querías el lunes cuando me llamaste."
    oma "You have to tell me what you wanted on Monday when you called me."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3396
translate english c14s006_Christmas_325f881f:

    # mc "Te tengo que contar muchas cosas, Alexia, pero habrá tiempo."
    mc "I have a lot of things to tell you, Alexia, but there will be time."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3397
translate english c14s006_Christmas_caa9a5c2:

    # mc "Creo que te estaban esperando para comer. A estas alturas Tía Betty se tiene que estar muriendo de hambre."
    mc "I think they were waiting for you to have lunch. Aunt Betty has to be starving by now."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3399
translate english c14s006_Christmas_3f8bae97:

    # "Recogéis las sombrillas y las sillas y os dirigís al merendero."
    "You gather the parasols and chairs, and head to the picnic area."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3400
translate english c14s006_Christmas_171f3852:

    # "Emma y Scarlett reparten gorros navideños para todos."
    "Emma and Scarlett hand out Christmas hats to everyone."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3402
translate english c14s006_Christmas_6d2bc954:

    # "Después de lo que ha pasado durante la mañana, no te extraña que los grupos se entremezclen."
    "After what happened during the morning, no wonder the groups are intermingling."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3404
translate english c14s006_Christmas_007c3147:

    # "No parece haber diferencia entre familia, estudiantes, y las chicas de la ciudad."
    "There seems to be no difference between family, students, and city girls."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3406
translate english c14s006_Christmas_06c9ac7f:

    # "Todo el mundo parece dispuesto a pasárselo bien y disfrutar de la comida."
    "Everyone seems willing to have a good time and enjoy the food."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3408
translate english c14s006_Christmas_1d87fb41:

    # "Algunos gorros duran poco en las cabezas y acaban encima de la mesa. Hace demasiado calor para llevarlos en pleno verano."
    "Some hats are short-lived on the heads and end up on the table. It's too hot to wear them in the middle of summer."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3410
translate english c14s006_Christmas_a9208bfb:

    # "Es vuestra primera Navidad juntos. ¿Quién sabe cómo será la próxima, la de verdad?"
    "It's your first Christmas together. Who knows what the next one will be like, the real one?"

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3419
translate english c14s006_Christmas_b2b9fa2b:

    # "Hay más gente que te gustaría que estuviera aquí. Y todavía faltan por llegar las últimas estudiantes. En la Navidad de verdad estarán."
    "There are more people you'd like to have here. And there are still the last students to arrive. By Christmas they'll really be here."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3420
translate english c14s006_Christmas_2031e2a1:

    # "¿Pero habrá vuelto Meemaw a Florida por entonces? ¿Tía Betty estará en algún hospital de África?"
    "But will Meemaw be back in Florida by then? Will Aunt Betty be in some African hospital?"

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3422
translate english c14s006_Christmas_b3eee4f3:

    # "La sonrisa de Scarlett te saca de tus ensoñaciones."
    "Scarlett's smile brings you out of your daydreaming."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3423
translate english c14s006_Christmas_4b9e4cd6:

    # sca "¿Pasa algo, [mc]? Te veo ausente..."
    sca "Is something wrong, [mc]? You look absentminded..."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3424
translate english c14s006_Christmas_85f4e9f8:

    # mc "No, cielo, no pasa nada. Solo estaba pensando en la próxima Navidad, la de verdad."
    mc "No, sweetie, I'm fine. I was just thinking about next Christmas, the real thing."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3426
translate english c14s006_Christmas_0a62ee21:

    # sca "La verdad es que ésta ha salido un poco sosa, ¿cierto? Al final es un día de playa comiendo con ridículos gorros navideños."
    sca "The truth is that this one came out a little bland, didn't it? In the end it's a day at the beach eating with ridiculous Christmas hats."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3427
translate english c14s006_Christmas_007ebe11:

    # mc "¡Hey! No es nada sosa. No había visto nunca a 19 personas pasándoselo bien juntos sin malos rollos. Y menos habiendo familia en la mezcla."
    mc "Hey, it's not bland at all. I've never seen 19 people having a good time together without any bad blood. Especially with family in the mix."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3429
translate english c14s006_Christmas_bcfa7996:

    # sca "La verdad es que tienes una familia increíble. Gracias por acogerme, [mc]. A [nor], a [mar] y a las chicas las he inundado de gracias, pero si no hubiera sido por ti..."
    sca "The truth is that you have an incredible family. Thank you for taking me in, [mc]. I already flooded [nor], [mar] and the girls with thanks, but if it hadn't been for you..."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3430
translate english c14s006_Christmas_12abece5:

    # mc "No hace falta que des las gracias. Y te equivocas en una cosa, no tengo una familia increíble. La tenemos. Tú, yo, las chicas..."
    mc "No need to say thank you. And you're wrong about one thing, I don't have an amazing family. We do. You, me, the girls..."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3431
translate english c14s006_Christmas_a9087ca8:

    # mc "Mira lo que has conseguido que hagamos y dime que no parecemos una gran familia."
    mc "Look at what you've gotten us to do and tell me we don't look like one big family."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3432
translate english c14s006_Christmas_f015529a:

    # sca "*Risa* Nada que ver con mi concepto de familia. No hay nadie discutiendo. Me podría acostumbrar a esto."
    sca "*Laugh* Nothing to do with my concept of family. There's no one arguing. I could get used to this."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3433
translate english c14s006_Christmas_6d4d214a:

    # mc "Lo harás. No pensamos dejarte escapar. *Risa*"
    mc "You will. We don't plan on letting you get away. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3435
translate english c14s006_Christmas_b110a990:

    # sca "¡Vamos a hacernos una foto juntos!"
    sca "Let's take a picture together!"

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3436
translate english c14s006_Christmas_7e57e035:

    # mc "¿Una selfie?"
    mc "A selfie?"

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3437
translate english c14s006_Christmas_f81b7379:

    # sca "No, tonto, una foto de toda la familia junta."
    sca "No, silly, a picture of the whole family together."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3438
translate english c14s006_Christmas_57d4b6c8:

    # mc "¡Vamos!"
    mc "Let's go!"

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3440
translate english c14s006_Christmas_d54ed7b9:

    # "Scarlett propone la foto y todo el mundo responde entusiasmado."
    "Scarlett proposes the picture and everyone responds enthusiastically."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3442
translate english c14s006_Christmas_2117895e:

    # todas "¡Feliz Navidad!"
    todas "Merry Christmas!"

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3443
translate english c14s006_Christmas_71f0ba30:

    # "Con el paso del tiempo, los que salís en la foto consideraréis ese momento como el pistoletazo de salida para vuestra familia."
    "In years to come, those of you in the picture will look back at this moment as the starting point for your family."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3444
translate english c14s006_Christmas_1eb8fe7c:

    # "Las chicas que se unirán a la familia en los próximos meses mirarán la foto deseando haber estado allí, haber formado parte de la familia desde el primer día."
    "The girls who will be joining the family in the coming months will look at the picture wishing they had been there, wishing they had been part of the family from day one."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3445
translate english c14s006_Christmas_6299b99f:

    # "Nadie lo sabe en ese momento, pero esa foto acabará en el despacho de la primera Gobernadora de California muchos años después."
    "No one knows it at the time, but that picture will end up in the office of California's first female governor many years later."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3446
translate english c14s006_Christmas_0b08f94d:

    # "Y más años después todavía, estará encima del escritorio Resolute, en el despacho Oval. Pero esa es otra historia."
    "And even more years later, it will be on the Resolute Desk, in the Oval Office. But that's another story."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3448
translate english c14s006_Christmas_d79c5293:

    # "Después de la foto todo el mundo sigue con sus conversaciones. Si la conversación era animada antes, ahora lo es incluso más."
    "After taking the picture, everyone goes on with their conversations. If the conversation was lively before, it's even more so now."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3450
translate english c14s006_Christmas_7dbeec67:

    # dap "Nos deberiamos ir yendo, [mc]."
    dap "We should go, [mc]."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3451
translate english c14s006_Christmas_1384af00:

    # mc "¿A dónde?"
    mc "Where to?"

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3453
translate english c14s006_Christmas_845213ff:

    # dap "No te acuerdas, ¿verdad? Tenemos que ir a la tienda de Maddie para hacer vuestros personajes de DnD."
    dap "You don't remember, do you? We have to go to Maddie's store to make your DnD characters."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3454
translate english c14s006_Christmas_feeb53b3:

    # mc "Pues no, no me acordaba para nada."
    mc "Well, no, I forgot about it. I’m sorry."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3455
translate english c14s006_Christmas_d0ab2d02:

    # mc "Vamos a despedirnos de todo el mundo, cogemos unos gorros, y vamos para allí. Voy a ver si queda alguna botella de cava."
    mc "Let's say goodbye to everyone, grab some hats, and head over there. I'm going to see if there are any bottles of cava left."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3457
translate english c14s006_Christmas_b05ff61a:

    # dap "¿Cava? ¿Gorros?"
    dap "Cava? Hats?"

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3458
translate english c14s006_Christmas_1c1f91b1:

    # mc "No querrás dejar a Maddie sin celebrar la Navidad, ¿verdad? *Risa*"
    mc "You don't want to leave Maddie without celebrating Christmas, do you? *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3463
translate english c14s006_KissMartha_774bc444:

    # mom "¿Te importa?"
    mom "Do you mind?"

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3464
translate english c14s006_KissMartha_98a2015f:

    # mc "No, hace tiempo que lo estaba deseando."
    mc "No, I've been looking forward to this for a long time."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3467
translate english c14s006_KissMartha_142cd168:

    # "Tal como ha pasado con [nor], el mundo vuelve a desaparecer. Sabes que la voz de Meemaw está subiendo de tono, pero decides no escucharla."
    "Just as happened with [nor], the world disappears again. You know Meemaw's voice is rising in pitch, but you decide not to listen to her."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3469
translate english c14s006_KissMartha_7eb6706a:

    # "El mundo desaparece a vuestro alrededor. Sabes que la voz de Meemaw está subiendo de tono, pero decides no escucharla."
    "The world disappears around you. You know Meemaw's voice is rising in pitch, but you decide not to listen to her."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3471
translate english c14s006_KissMartha_fc4dea53:

    # mom "No sabes que peso de encima me he quitado."
    mom "I feel like a big weight has been lifted off my shoulders."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3472
translate english c14s006_KissMartha_6b85ac1c:

    # mc "Lo sé. Salir a la luz es una sensación increíble."
    mc "I know. Coming out in the open is an amazing feeling."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3473
translate english c14s006_KissMartha_f7ae8057:

    # mom "Ahora viene el problema. ¿Nos giramos y las escuchamos?"
    mom "Now comes the problem. Shall we turn around and listen to them?"

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3475
translate english c14s006_KissMartha_0e30a3fb:

    # mee "¿Estáis todos locos? ¿Sabéis lo que estáis haciendo?"
    mee "Are you crazy? Do you know what you're doing?"

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3478
translate english c14s007_MaddieDnD_4c84d95a:

    # "Llegáis a la tienda de ropa y Maddie está sola, no hay ningún cliente."
    "You arrive at the clothing store and Maddie is alone, there are no customers."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3480
translate english c14s007_MaddieDnD_061e2002:

    # mad "Buenas tardes, [dap]. [mc]."
    mad "Good afternoon, [dap]. [mc]."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3481
translate english c14s007_MaddieDnD_7b78d6ee:

    # mc "Hola, Maddie. ¿No tienes clientes hoy?"
    mc "Hi, Maddie. No customers today?"

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3482
translate english c14s007_MaddieDnD_ad0568c2:

    # mad "No suele haber clientes a esta hora en los días laborables. Un poco más tarde quizás."
    mad "There are usually no customers at this time on weekdays. A little later perhaps."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3484
translate english c14s007_MaddieDnD_f23f573a:

    # dap "Entonces genial. Podemos hacer vuestros personajes sin interrupción."
    dap "That's great then. We can do your characters without interruption."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3485
translate english c14s007_MaddieDnD_42961c19:

    # mc "Pero antes vamos a brindar, ¿no?"
    mc "But let's have a toast first, shall we?"

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3487
translate english c14s007_MaddieDnD_f5d43592:

    # mad "¿Brindar? ¿Por qué?"
    mad "Toast? Why?"

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3488
translate english c14s007_MaddieDnD_4901a442:

    # mc "Hemos celebrado una fiesta navideña en la playa y te hemos traído un poco de cava... sin alcohol, que tú estás trabajando y yo tengo que conducir luego."
    mc "We had a Christmas party on the beach and we brought you some cava... without alcohol. You're working and I have to drive later."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3489
translate english c14s007_MaddieDnD_fbc35e0b:

    # mad "¿Navidad? ¿En Julio? ¿Para eso queríais los gorros de Santa ayer?"
    mad "Christmas? In July? Is that what you wanted the Santa hats for?"

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3491
translate english c14s007_MaddieDnD_3bc0af21:

    # dap "Sí, por lo visto es una costumbre italiana y Scarlett, mi amiga, leyo sobre ella. Lo propuso y lo hemos hecho. *Risa*"
    dap "Yes, apparently it's an Italian custom and Scarlett, my friend, read about it. She suggested it and we've done it. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3492
translate english c14s007_MaddieDnD_fe055228:

    # mc "Ha sido divertido. Un dia de playa normal y comida con los gorros. Mucho espíritu navideño sin que nadie discutiera."
    mc "It's been fun. Just a normal beach day and lunch with the hats. Lots of Christmas spirit with no one arguing."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3494
translate english c14s007_MaddieDnD_995e76bd:

    # dap "Y sin regalos..."
    dap "And without presents..."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3495
translate english c14s007_MaddieDnD_a11e50be:

    # mc "¿Quieres un regalo? Estás en una tienda de ropa... corre de mi cuenta. *Risa*"
    mc "Do you want a present? We are in a clothing store... it's on me. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3497
translate english c14s007_MaddieDnD_cfb16629:

    # mad "Estáis locos, pero trae ese champagne. *Risa*"
    mad "You're crazy, but bring that champagne. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3498
translate english c14s007_MaddieDnD_06553e8d:

    # mc "Es cava..."
    mc "It's cava..."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3499
translate english c14s007_MaddieDnD_2dca0aea:

    # mad "Bueno, lo que sea. *Risa*"
    mad "Well, whatever. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3501
translate english c14s007_MaddieDnD_003746c6:

    # mc "Feliz Navidad, Maddie."
    mc "Merry Christmas, Maddie."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3502
translate english c14s007_MaddieDnD_04b7c815:

    # dap "¡Feliz Navidad!" (multiple=2)
    dap "Merry Christmas!" (multiple=2)

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3503
translate english c14s007_MaddieDnD_0c9ede57:

    # mad "¡Feliz Navidad, chicos!" (multiple=2)
    mad "Merry Christmas, guys!" (multiple=2)

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3505
translate english c14s007_MaddieDnD_482f9740:

    # dap "¿Podemos hacer los personajes ya? He traído la tablet para apuntar los datos. En casa, [emm] hará una ilustración de vuestros personajes y tendréis la hoja de personaje en papel."
    dap "Can we make the characters now? I brought the tablet to write down the data. At home, [emm] will do an illustration of your characters and you will have the character sheet on paper."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3506
translate english c14s007_MaddieDnD_074455aa:

    # mc "Me vas a tener que explicar como funciona todo."
    mc "You need to explain to me how it all works."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3507
translate english c14s007_MaddieDnD_1241d032:

    # dap "Ningún problema. Ya te expliqué el mundo. Ahora te enseñaré las reglas."
    dap "No problem. I've already explained part of the world to you. Now I'll teach you the rules."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3509
translate english c14s007_MaddieDnD_1511a305:

    # mad "Deberías explicarme el mundo a mí también."
    mad "You should explain the world to me too."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3510
translate english c14s007_MaddieDnD_2029f14a:

    # mc "Es super original, al menos para alguien que nunca ha jugado a esto."
    mc "What little she explained to me is super original, at least for someone who has never played this game."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3518
translate english c14s007_MaddieDnD_6f7a6ac9:

    # dap "Imagínate nuestro mundo a finales del Siglo II. El Imperio Romano está en su auge. Entonces se abren una serie de portales a otros mundos y entran los diferentes seres de fantasía."
    dap "Imagine our world at the end of the 2nd century. The Roman Empire is at its height. Then a series of portals to other worlds open and the various fantasy beings enter."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3519
translate english c14s007_MaddieDnD_7e12dd88:

    # dap "Elfos, orcos, enanos, dragones... Pero no solo entran ellos, sino que además sus Dioses les acompañan. Y también la magia."
    dap "Elves, orcs, dwarves, dragons... Not only do they pass through the portals, but also their Gods accompany them. And magic too."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3521
translate english c14s007_MaddieDnD_9bc0bac6:

    # mad "Pobres romanos. Les va a caer la del pulpo."
    mad "Poor Romans. They're going to be in for a treat."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3522
translate english c14s007_MaddieDnD_c1d3dfb0:

    # mc "Yo pensé lo mismo, pero espera..."
    mc "I thought the same, but wait..."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3524
translate english c14s007_MaddieDnD_be5d83ef:

    # dap "Esos pueblos aparecen muy al norte y muy al sur. Elfos, Enanos y Medianos en Escandinavia, los pueblos faericos en las Islas Británicas, y los Orcos y Goblins en Siberia."
    dap "These people appear far north and far south. Elves, Dwarves and Halflings in Scandinavia, Faeric peoples in Scotland, and Orcs and Goblins in Siberia."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3525
translate english c14s007_MaddieDnD_7e3d5ef7:

    # dap "Hay otras razas en otras partes del planeta de las que vuestros personajes no han oído hablar, con lo que no entraré en ello."
    dap "There are other races in other parts of the planet that your characters haven't heard of, so I won't go into it."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3526
translate english c14s007_MaddieDnD_333a7a0c:

    # dap "La parte que nos interesa es Europa. La partida se desarrolla en lo que hoy en día es Austria."
    dap "The part we are interested in is Europe. The game takes place in what is now Austria."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3528
translate english c14s007_MaddieDnD_99bcbc7b:

    # mad "Déjame adivinar, los pueblos que llegan se pelan a los Germanos y los Alpes se convierten en la frontera."
    mad "Let me guess, the incoming peoples kill the Germanic tribes and the Alps become the frontier."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3530
translate english c14s007_MaddieDnD_48023f27:

    # dap "Más o menos. Los Germanos desaparecen, son absorbidos, o se refugian en el Imperio, y los Enanos fundan sus reinos en la cara norte de los Alpes."
    dap "More or less. The Germans disappear, are absorbed, or take refuge in the Empire, and the Dwarves found their kingdoms on the north side of the Alps."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3531
translate english c14s007_MaddieDnD_fda8cec8:

    # dap "Los elfos atraviesan la Galia y se establecen en lo que sería España, Portugal y el sur de Francia."
    dap "Elves cross Gaul and settle in what would become modern-day Spain, Portugal, and southern France."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3532
translate english c14s007_MaddieDnD_5218815c:

    # dap "Los romanos no tienen nada que hacer sin magia en ese momento y reciben hostias en todos lados. En menos de un siglo han perdido toda Europa Occidental."
    dap "The Romans had nothing to do without magic at that time and lost battles everywhere. In less than a century they lose all of Western Europe."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3533
translate english c14s007_MaddieDnD_4d42de70:

    # dap "Pero junto con las razas invasoras también han llegado Dioses que no son adorados por ninguna raza. Esos Dioses se identifican con el Panteón Romano y empiezan a dar poderes a sus sacerdotes."
    dap "But along with the invading races have also come Gods who are not worshipped by any race. These Gods identify themselves with the Roman Pantheon and begin to empower their priests."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3535
translate english c14s007_MaddieDnD_a5917141:

    # mad "Y eso equilibra la balanza. Las legiones con clérigos curándolas pueden ser un espectáculo."
    mad "And that balances the scales. Legions with clerics healing them can be very powerful."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3536
translate english c14s007_MaddieDnD_aef893fb:

    # mad "¿Qué hay del Cristianismo?"
    mad "What about Christianity?"

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3538
translate english c14s007_MaddieDnD_84736935:

    # dap "Prácticamente desaparece, igual que el judaísmo. En un mundo con múltiples Dioses dando poderes a sus clérigos, el precepto del único Dios verdadero no se sustenta."
    dap "It practically disappears, just like Judaism. In a world with multiple Gods empowering their clerics, no one believes in the precept of the one and only true God."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3539
translate english c14s007_MaddieDnD_37ed1056:

    # dap "Y ningún Dios quiere dar poderes a los sacerdotes de esos Dioses. Si lo hacen, estarían negando la existencia de otros Dioses que está muy clara."
    dap "And no God wants to empower the priests of those \"one and only\" Gods. If they do, they would be denying the existence of other Gods which is very clear. Monotheism dies."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3541
translate english c14s007_MaddieDnD_b5d4dd59:

    # mad "Me gusta, tiene lógica. Pero aún queda la magia de los magos... Los elfos tienen y los romanos no."
    mad "I like it, it makes sense. But there's still the wizard's magic... Elves have it and Romans don't."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3543
translate english c14s007_MaddieDnD_6c90460d:

    # dap "Los humanos no somos tontos del todo y en el primer siglo de luchas la gente aprende cómo funciona la magia. Los nuevos Dioses les ayudan a entenderlo."
    dap "Humans are not dumb at all and, in the first century of fighting, people learn how magic works. The new Gods help them understand it."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3545
translate english c14s007_MaddieDnD_c1eab4a3:

    # dap "Total que la paz se establece al cabo de un siglo y medio. El norte de los Alpes y de los Cárpatos son los Reinos Enanos."
    dap "Peace is established after a century and a half. North of the Alps and the Carpathian Mountains are the Dwarven Kingdoms."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3546
translate english c14s007_MaddieDnD_a89899b3:

    # dap "España, Portugal y el sur de Francia es territorio elfo. Italia, los Balcanes, Turquía, y toda la costa del Mediterraneo menos lo que tienen los elfos es Romano."
    dap "Modern Spain, Portugal, and Southern France is elven territory. Italy, the Balkans, Turkey, and the entire Mediterranean coastline minus what the elves have is Roman."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3548
translate english c14s007_MaddieDnD_25678638:

    # dap "Pasan los siglos y los Enanos empiezan a expandirse echando a los Elfos de sus territorios. El Macizo Central de Francia, los Pirineos, y al final toda España."
    dap "A few centuries later the Dwarves begin to expand by driving the Elves out of their territories. The Massif Central of France, the Pyrenees, and finally all of Spain."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3549
translate english c14s007_MaddieDnD_52fceac4:

    # dap "En este mundo la enemistad de Elfos y Enanos nace ahí. Los Elfos que quedan tienen que pedir asilo en el Imperio Romano, que se parece más al final de la Edad Media."
    dap "In this world the enmity of Elves and Dwarves is born then. The remaining Elves have to seek asylum in the Roman Empire, which is more like the end of the Middle Ages."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3550
translate english c14s007_MaddieDnD_e61e64b8:

    # dap "Ahí empieza el equivalente del Renacimiento en este mundo. Algunos siglos antes. En lo que sería nuestro Siglo X, pero sin Cristianismo nadie le llama así."
    dap "Then begins the equivalent of the Renaissance in this world, a few centuries earlier, in what would be our 10th Century but, without Christianity, no one calls it that."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3552
translate english c14s007_MaddieDnD_52dd91f2:

    # mad "Me gusta. ¿Y qué pasa en Asia? Querría hacerme un personaje que viniera de allí, si es posible."
    mad "I like it. And what about Asia? I'd want to make a character for myself that came from there, if possible."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3554
translate english c14s007_MaddieDnD_2ca7a2ec:

    # dap "Ningún problema. Los Orcos le han dado de hostias a los Chinos. No hay ningún Dios que les quiera ayudar porque ponen a su Emperador al mismo nivel que los Dioses."
    dap "No problem. The Orcs have beaten the shit out of the Chinese. There is no God who wants to help them because they put their Emperor on the same level as the Gods."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3555
translate english c14s007_MaddieDnD_8894c41e:

    # mc "Creo que yo eso no lo tengo que saber, ¿no? Mientras se lo explicas voy al lavabo. ¿Dónde está, Maddie?"
    mc "I don't think I'm supposed to know that, am I? While you're explaining it to her, I'm going to the restroom. Where is it, Maddie?"

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3557
translate english c14s007_MaddieDnD_dc7a102f:

    # mad "La puerta de la izquierda de los probadores da a un pasillo. Ahí está el lavabo."
    mad "The door to the left of the changing rooms leads to a hallway. That's where the restroom is."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3558
translate english c14s007_MaddieDnD_0d2bbdb7:

    # mc "OK, Ahora vuelvo."
    mc "OK. I'll be back in a moment."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3560
translate english c14s007_MaddieDnD_be862ec1:

    # "Acabas de lavarte las manos después de hacer eso que solo puedes hacer sentado, cuando..."
    "You just washed your hands after doing that thing you can only do sitting down, when..."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3561
translate english c14s007_MaddieDnD_dd0461ef:

    # "*Knock-Knock*"
    "*Knock-Knock*"

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3562
translate english c14s007_MaddieDnD_75924a45:

    # mad "*A través de la puerta* ¿Te encuentras bien? Ya hemos acabado mi personaje."
    mad "*Through the door* Are you all right? We're done with my character."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3563
translate english c14s007_MaddieDnD_e617c3f5:

    # mc "Si, ahora salgo. Habéis sido muy rápidas."
    mc "Yes, I'll be right out. You guys have been very quick."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3564
translate english c14s007_MaddieDnD_474d4131:

    # mad "*A través de la puerta* Con la aplicación que tiene [dap] en la tablet el personaje se hace muy rápido."
    mad "*Through the door* With the app that [dap] has on the tablet the character is done very quickly."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3566
translate english c14s007_MaddieDnD_f3c3dd4b:

    # mc "¿Qué te has hecho?"
    mc "What character did you choose?"

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3567
translate english c14s007_MaddieDnD_d0c83c5b:

    # mad "*Risa* Tendrás que esperar a la partida para descubrirlo. Puede ser muy divertido."
    mad "*Laugh* You'll have to wait for the game to find out. It could be a lot of fun."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3570
translate english c14s007_MaddieDnD_fe3a1791:

    # mad "Tenía ganas de estar a solas contigo. Feliz Navidad."
    mad "I was looking forward to being alone with you. Merry Christmas."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3571
translate english c14s007_MaddieDnD_87b0ef7f:

    # mc "Feliz Navidad, preciosa."
    mc "Merry Christmas, gorgeous."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3573
translate english c14s007_MaddieDnD_ab09920f:

    # mad "¿Quieres que volvamos a quedar el viernes en mi casa?"
    mad "Do you want to meet again on Friday at my house?"

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3574
translate english c14s007_MaddieDnD_f6b4a967:

    # mc "Por mí genial. ¿Otra película?"
    mc "Great for me. Another movie?"

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3576
translate english c14s007_MaddieDnD_ffb66364:

    # mad "Para no acabar de verla, mejor no empezarla, ¿no?"
    mad "It's better not to start it if we won't finish it, isn't it?"

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3577
translate english c14s007_MaddieDnD_34a4903f:

    # mc "Tienes razón. ¿Te recojo a las 6 como la semana pasada?"
    mc "You're right. Do you want me to pick you up at 6 o'clock like last week?"

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3579
translate english c14s007_MaddieDnD_6bebe949:

    # mad "Perfecto. A ver si esta vez no te tienes que ir con prisas."
    mad "Perfect. Let's see if this time you don't have to leave in a hurry."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3580
translate english c14s007_MaddieDnD_d272b675:

    # mc "¡Mierda! Me acabo de acordar que es posible que tenga que recoger a una amiga en Westport el viernes. Pero no sé a que hora, ni siquiera si tendré que ir a buscarla."
    mc "Shit! I just remembered that I may have to pick up a friend in Westport on Friday. But I don't know what time, or even if I'll have to pick her up."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3582
translate english c14s007_MaddieDnD_b7d653e7:

    # mad "Lástima. Si no puedes venir a recogerme, podemos quedar directamente en mi casa."
    mad "Too bad. If you can't come pick me up, we can meet directly at my place."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3583
translate english c14s007_MaddieDnD_c7ee817a:

    # mc "En cuanto sepa algo te lo digo. Espero poder venir."
    mc "As soon as I know something I'll let you know. I hope I can come."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3586
translate english c14s007_MaddieDnD_eeb50fb2:

    # mad "Quería hacer esto, pero no quería dejarte en evidencia delante de tu prima. Feliz Navidad, [mc]."
    mad "I wanted to do this, but I didn't want to embarrass you in front of your cousin. Merry Christmas, [mc]."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3587
translate english c14s007_MaddieDnD_6e590a76:

    # mc "Feliz Navidad, Ama."
    mc "Merry Christmas, Mistress."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3589
translate english c14s007_MaddieDnD_b13729ad:

    # mad "Pásame a buscar el viernes a las 6 como la semana pasada e iremos a mi casa."
    mad "Pick me up on Friday at 6 o'clock like last week and we'll go to my house."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3590
translate english c14s007_MaddieDnD_6f38d93e:

    # mc "Como quieras. ¿Otra película?"
    mc "As you wish. Another movie?"

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3592
translate english c14s007_MaddieDnD_40be0102:

    # mad "Para no acabar de verla, mejor no empezarla. Tengo otros planes para ti."
    mad "If you don't want to finish watching it, it's better not to start it. I have other plans for you."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3593
translate english c14s007_MaddieDnD_e69ff576:

    # mc "Espero que esos planes incluyan hablar de lo nuestro... si quieres."
    mc "I hope those plans include talking about us... if you want to."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3595
translate english c14s007_MaddieDnD_99c2d079:

    # mad "Si te portas bien, sí, podremos hablar. Quedamos a las 6 entonces."
    mad "If you behave yourself, yes, we can talk. Let's meet at 6 then."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3596
translate english c14s007_MaddieDnD_d272b675_1:

    # mc "¡Mierda! Me acabo de acordar que es posible que tenga que recoger a una amiga en Westport el viernes. Pero no sé a que hora, ni siquiera si tendré que ir a buscarla."
    mc "Shit! I just remembered that I may have to pick up a friend in Westport on Friday. But I don't know what time, or even if I'll have to pick her up."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3597
translate english c14s007_MaddieDnD_8012d214:

    # mc "En cuanto sepa algo te lo digo."
    mc "As soon as I find out, I'll let you know."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3599
translate english c14s007_MaddieDnD_0a3fe072:

    # mad "¿Antepones a una amiga antes que a mí?"
    mad "Do you put your friend before me?"

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3600
translate english c14s007_MaddieDnD_21c2f1d4:

    # mc "Antepongo a cualquiera que me necesite antes que cualquier otra cosa. Espero que no te moleste."
    mc "I put anyone who needs me before anything else. I hope you don't mind."

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3602
translate english c14s007_MaddieDnD_cd1f66c5:

    # mad "¿Y si yo te necesitara en ese mismo momento?"
    mad "What if I needed you at that very moment?"

# game/scripts/c14/c14.rpy:3603
translate english c14s007_MaddieDnD_475476e3:

    # mc "Si fuera algo que no puede esperar, tendrías preferencia... Ama."
